  sp4: 'The Summer Games come every four years, a span the ancient Greeks called an Olympiad. Since 1994 the Winter Games fall two years in between.',
  sp5: 'Argentina beat France on penalties after a 3-3 final in Qatar, giving Lionel Messi the one major trophy he had never won.',
  sp6: 'Army and Navy have met on the football field since 1890. The game is traditionally the last regular-season game of the college season.',
  sp7: 'A full round is 18 holes, a standard set when Scotland\'s St Andrews cut its course from 22 holes to 18 in 1764.',
