  sp112: 'A hat trick is three goals. The term comes from cricket, where a bowler who took three wickets in three balls was given a hat.',
  sp113: 'A red card sends a player off, and the team plays a man short. Two yellow cards in one match also add up to a red.',
  sp114: 'Kentucky Derby winners are draped in a blanket of over 400 red roses. The race at Churchill Downs has been run every year since 1875.',
  sp115: 'Fenway\'s left-field wall stands about 37 feet tall. It was painted green in 1947, and the "Green Monster" name followed.',
